What is here:
  testdata/*.drc, testdata/*.obj   Draco's own test files (bitstream 2.2:
      sequential and EdgeBreaker, compression levels 3, 4 and 10) and the
      Wavefront files they were made from. Used by the decoder's tests.

What was read:
  The Draco bitstream specification (https://google.github.io/draco/spec/,
  version 2.2). crates/shape-tools/src/draco.rs is written from it and
  keeps its names in comments. Draco's C++ source was not copied; where
  the specification leaves something out (the bit order of a bit run,
  whole numbers stored uncompressed, a boundary vertex in a traversal),
  what Draco's format does is stated in docs/research.md §44.
